            "name": "Breakfast",
            "description": "<p>Mornings have never been so tasty! Build your own breakfast and fill up your plate with freshly cooked favourites like bacon, sausages, eggs and hash browns – plus a tasty selection of veggie and vegan options – and continental delights like fruit, cereal and freshly baked pastries. Plus, when an adult orders a Premier Inn Breakfast, up to two kids eat breakfast for free**</p>\r\n",
            "imageSrc": "/content/dam/global/restaurants/Global/breakfast-pancake-tacos2.jpg",
            "menuSrc": "/content/dam/global/restaurants/Global/premier-inn-breakfast.pdf",
            "menuLabel": "Breakfast Menu",
            "disclaimer": "Depending on your selected hotel and dates you stay, we will be offering different breakfast and evening options. "
          },
          {
            "name": "Dinner",
            "description": "<p>Enjoy favourites like beer-battered haddock and chips, mixed grill or our 30-day aged steaks. For dessert, try our delicious triple chocolate brownie or cool off with a Cadbury nibbles sundae.</p>\r\n",
            "imageSrc": "/content/dam/global/restaurants/Global/value-pubs-chicken&mushroompie.png",
